abstract: >-
  missdetect is a research codebase that classifies the missingness mechanism
  (MCAR / MAR / MNAR) of one incomplete numerical column of a table from the
  observed data only. The package missdetect.rb contains the pre-registered
  experiments of the thesis: controlled injection of missing values into
  complete real tables, observable descriptors, direct and hierarchical
  classifiers, reference methods, statistical analysis by dataset family and
  an evaluation of large language models under leakage controls. The code
  outside missdetect.rb is the legacy pipeline of the qualification version.
